# oh-my-openagent leaves this behind wherever it runs, this repo included
.omo/
# A symlink into the codegraph index. The marketplace validator refuses a symlink
# anywhere in a plugin folder, and this was being kept out of git by
# .git/info/exclude alone — which is local, and never leaves this machine.
.codegraph
# Exported agent-session transcripts, dropped in the repo root by hand.
session-*.md
# Editor leftovers, kept out the same way the sibling plugins keep them out.
*.swp
*~
